e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9wRemUSkn38Q7kNvwGGz07F&_nc_oc=AdprC4AkmN-QMbDbXdTiXWeRgNiceM47ygGyoQVUSGFc6W3q6Xa5-MJFxH8E-TMBIOI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4Ikej1N8mauICg2WhubM1Hyi5gRFARbOyKGJBU-bMGGg&oe=69FA07F9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mFN3F25Jgd8Q7kNvwHlAD6T&_nc_oc=AdoNYvwYRrUEVEC76296IxMY_A3UDoQPwkEmEaDvHDQ4-8XPphWX12iYQMsnPCQtvTc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5GqXdPu1DdQ6x5QNZ65sj0c4xuRmxER32PC5LjyA5RDw&oe=69F9DF53"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y1agXpKyWmAQ7kNvwGfMT0q&_nc_oc=AdodjnZMz7XITz_cyjHxJzF7d494Xgsz0Ts_lzlJkPXm_SVKV9UUqE9nPF4IAYo4YIQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4PZa01zvN6rYvYGb29bFWbF8eDJucWYZHe2XPSla3VUw&oe=69F9EAFB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OP4GgREsJe4Q7kNvwGPjtFu&_nc_oc=AdrEwE3q0qWvd_9Geo1G5UXtqBtoJ8kKAcrLkklOzN1Np2D1Vms3ZeKc_0RBd44h9GE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5_v0SNU3PwDVsHXDNJh-K3HQZq2pJqmJewCWPi-wY8iQ&oe=69F9EC4A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ODtOrqPy2mcQ7kNvwFxFReG&_nc_oc=Adr_ty6-bqk2VIG8snINtoafM57O1EGFTNw6X67JzeYEx6cxN5QM8W0LjlRcQ1SWuwA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6nhPXbK7h1NbIjizL5NN_drtrOLMeXD25bip7Vg3qHZA&oe=69FA0DBE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se